WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.967
One screen. Your phones. And that
friend who says they don't get competitive.

00:00:05.467 --> 00:00:09.400
We set out to build a
party racer. The cars took that personally.

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:14.667
Built from reference sheets. Rebuilt until
the wheels finally got the message.

00:00:15.167 --> 00:00:19.067
Then we gave a sensible
car some deeply unreasonable roads.

00:00:19.567 --> 00:00:24.667
Take the risky line. Find your grip.
Make the next corner somebody else's problem.

00:00:25.167 --> 00:00:30.767
No installs. Just open a
browser, scan in, and race together.

00:00:31.267 --> 00:00:36.434
Joystick Jammers. Bring your friends. Leave
your dignity at the starting line.
